mermaid.structure:
flowchart TD
  Job[Integration job] --> Data{Operate on records?}
  Data -->|Yes interactive| Sync[REST SOAP Composite GraphQL UI]
  Data -->|Yes large async| Bulk[Bulk API 2.0]
  Job --> Meta{Change org customizations?}
  Meta -->|Deploy retrieve shapes| Md[Metadata API]
  Meta -->|Dev-tool metadata slices| Tool[Tooling API]
  Job --> Ui{Build Lightning record UI?}
  Ui --> UIAPI[UI API]

mermaid.decision:
flowchart TD
  Need[Need an API] --> Q1{How much over about 2000 records async?}
  Q1 -->|Yes| B[Bulk API 2.0]
  Q1 -->|No| Q2{Need WSDL XML contract?}
  Q2 -->|Yes| S[SOAP API]
  Q2 -->|No| Q3{Several related REST writes in one trip?}
  Q3 -->|Yes| C[Composite]
  Q3 -->|No| Q4{Only some fields plus related resources?}
  Q4 -->|Yes| G[GraphQL API]
  Q4 -->|No| Q5{Lightning UI metadata plus records?}
  Q5 -->|Yes| U[UI API]
  Q5 -->|No| R[REST API]
  Need --> Q6{Layouts objects as metadata?}
  Q6 -->|Yes| M[Metadata API not data APIs]
  Need --> Q7{Building a developer tool?}
  Q7 -->|Yes| T[Tooling API]
